# The environment variables of the application, without their values. Locally, copy this file to
# .env (ignored by Git); online, set them in the Netlify site settings. Never commit a value.

# The two shared codes, checked by the functions (specs.md, Access code and nicknames): the
# member code reads the bag, adds and votes; the admin code also moderates. Online, they are
# secret values of the contexts Production, Deploy previews and Branch deploys, for the Functions
# scope; locally, any throwaway values. Letters, digits and hyphens only: a code travels in a
# header. At least 12 characters for the member code, since nothing limits the tries, and an
# admin code longer still and different: the same value makes nobody admin.
MEMBER_CODE=
ADMIN_CODE=
